        "TileImage": "$($repository 9a49e606-9fc8-45bb-aff7-fa4e2a5eee62).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47. Your targets are Zaki Diab and Sebastian Krogh. Diab is a former Mossad interrogator turned fortune teller. He worked with Ezra Berg to try and identify the constant. He came too close. We would love for his death to reflect the ways he tortured Heralds for information. Krogh, formerly Steve Isenhower was an intern for Klaus Strandberg. He found some classified Providence files in Klaus&apos; safe and sold them on the black market. He now seeks guidance from the supernatural. Take them out",
